Relevant code which triggers this from devices/pci/pci.c is:
void pcim_pin_device(struct pci_dev *pdev)
{
	struct pci_devres *dr;

	dr = find_pci_dr(pdev);
	WARN_ON(!dr || !dr->disable);
	if (dr)
		dr->disable = 0;
}

and it is the WARN_ON that is the line.

